\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Objective versus economic cost on the decomposition lineage (EUR/yr). The Gurobi objective carries a systematic $\sim $39--41\,\% non-economic residual that is \emph  {not} a dispatch distortion: the objective charges CO$_2$ on a gross basis whereas the reported cost applies the standard cogeneration self-use allocation ($\approx $55--58\,k), plus a thermal-storage cycling penalty ($\approx $24--26\,k). Both are near-constant across levels and cancel in every bias/regret difference, so all reported figures use the economic cost.}}{8}{table.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
